%dw 2.0
output application/xml
ns open http://www.opensolutions.com/CoreApi
ns i http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance
ns a http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/OpenSolutions.CoreApiService.Services.Messages
---
